# Cloud Build source upload for the stream-service Dockerfile only needs
# pipeline/, server/, config/, and Dockerfile itself (see Dockerfile's own
# comment for why it lives at the repo root). Everything else here is either
# huge and irrelevant (site/, data/) or must never leave this machine
# (secrets/) - excluded explicitly rather than trusting .gitignore alone,
# since a credential accidentally reaching a Cloud Build upload is a
# meaningfully worse exposure than one reaching a private git remote.
.git/
.gcloudignore
secrets/
.env*
.vercel/
site/
data/
reports/
tests/
scripts/
docs/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.DS_Store
